{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"102743","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/102743","key":"MC-253183","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"16/Jun/22 9:29 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"TheBug%3A\"></a><b>The Bug:</b></h3>\n\n<p>The word \"Unrelated\" within the \"gui.chatSelection.fold\" string is incorrectly capitalized.</p>\n\n<p>This string currently reads \"%s Unrelated messages hidden\" (where \"%s\" represents a number), so there is no need to capitalize the word \"Unrelated\" here. In English, when a number is used at the beginning of a sentence, there is no need to capitalize the word that comes after it, and doing this is often seen as grammatically incorrect.</p>\n\n<p>Below, I've constructed a table that states all of the necessary and relevant information regarding this issue.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"AffectedString%3A\"></a><b>Affected String:</b></h3>\n\n<p>Before reading the table, please note the following:</p>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Words colored in&nbsp;<span class=\"#00875a\">GREEN</span>&nbsp;are correct.</li>\n\t<li>Words colored in&nbsp;<span class=\"#de350b\">RED</span>&nbsp;are incorrect.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\">\n<table class=\"confluenceTable\"><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">Translation Key</th>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">Current String</th>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">Expected String</th>\n<th class=\"confluenceTh\">String URL on Crowdin</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">gui.chatSelection.fold</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">%s <span class=\"#de350b\">Unrelated</span> messages hidden</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\">%s <span class=\"#00875a\">unrelated</span> messages hidden</td>\n<td class=\"confluenceTd\"><a href=\"https://crowdin.com/translate/minecraft/10002/enus-engb#5296050\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://crowdin.com/translate/minecraft/10002/enus-engb#5296050</a>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></h3>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Display this string by executing the command provided below.</li>\n\t<li><div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/tellraw @s {<span class=\"code-quote\">\"translate\"</span>:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"gui.chatSelection.fold\"</span>}</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Look closely at the capitalization within this string.</li>\n\t<li>Take note as to whether or not the word \"Unrelated\" within the \"gui.chatSelection.fold\" string is incorrectly capitalized.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ObservedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Observed Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>The word \"Unrelated\" is incorrectly capitalized.</p>\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a><b>Expected Behavior:</b></h3>\n\n<p>The word \"Unrelated\" would not be capitalized.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"16/Jun/22 4:31 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/134207","id":"134207","filename":"MC-253183.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/48","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/24","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/712020:fe0b28a2-a443-4748-adec-94acc213ea9e/5676b346-5dd0-49ca-b3b9-9eadab726d17/16","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.p